492
00:17:01,620 --> 00:17:02,460
No saben llegir bé.

493
00:17:03,060 --> 00:17:04,920
Cosa que és certa a nivell macro, no?

494
00:17:05,260 --> 00:17:07,420
Sí, és certa. Però atenció,

495
00:17:07,800 --> 00:17:09,160
